<div class="mockup-wrapper not-prose">
<div class="compare-grid">
      <div class="compare-card">
        <div class="compare-title before">Before: by hand</div>
        <p>Come up with a scenario, then hand-write every alert in the backend code: which host, which technique, which timestamp, for every step of every attacker. Reviewing a finished scenario meant reading raw alert records line by line.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="compare-card">
        <div class="compare-title after">After: with UnraveledPlayer</div>
        <p>Draw each attacker's path on the network diagram in the browser. The tool generates the alerts in the exact format the pipeline expects, and reviewing a scenario is as simple as playing the attack sequence back in time order.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
</div>

<style>

    *, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }

    .mockup-wrapper {
      --bg: var(--color-paper);
      --bg-card: var(--color-surface);
      --bg-surface: var(--color-line);
      --text: var(--color-ink);
      --text-muted: var(--color-ink-soft);
      --text-faint: var(--color-ink-soft);
      --border: var(--color-line);
      --border-med: var(--color-line);
      --font: var(--font-body);
      --mono: var(--font-mono);
      --radius: 10px;
      --radius-lg: 14px;
      --teal: #1D9E75;
      --coral: #D85A30;
    }

    :global(.dark) .mockup-wrapper {
        --bg: var(--color-paper);
        --bg-card: var(--color-surface);
        --bg-surface: var(--color-line);
        --text: var(--color-ink);
        --text-muted: var(--color-ink-soft);
        --text-faint: var(--color-ink-soft);
        --border: var(--color-line);
        --border-med: var(--color-line);
        --teal: #2dbd8f;
        --coral: #e06b40;
      }

    .mockup-wrapper {
      font-family: var(--font);
      background: var(--bg);
      color: var(--text);
      font-size: 15px;
      line-height: 1.6;
      padding: 0;
    }

    .container { max-width: 900px; margin: 0 auto; }

    nav { margin-bottom: 3rem; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 1rem; }
    .back-link {
      font-size: 13px; color: var(--text-muted); text-decoration: none;
      display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 5px;
      transition: color 0.15s;
    }
    .back-link:hover { color: var(--text); }

    h1 { font-size: 32px; font-weight: 300; letter-spacing: -0.02em; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; }
    .subtitle { color: var(--text-muted); margin-bottom: 2rem; max-width: 640px; font-style: italic; font-size: 13px; }

    /* BADGES */
    .badge-row { display: flex; gap: 0.8rem; margin-bottom: 2rem; flex-wrap: wrap; }
    .badge {
      display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;
      padding: 4px 12px; border-radius: 99px; background: var(--bg-surface);
      font-size: 12px; font-weight: 500; color: var(--text);
      border: 0.5px solid var(--border);
    }
    .badge-live::before {
      content: ''; width: 7px; height: 7px; border-radius: 50%;
      background: var(--teal);
    }

    /* CTA */
    .cta-row { display: flex; gap: 1rem; align-items: center; flex-wrap: wrap; margin-bottom: 1rem; }
    .cta-button {
      display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;
      padding: 10px 22px; border-radius: 99px;
      background: var(--text); color: var(--bg);
      font-size: 13px; font-weight: 500; text-decoration: none;
      border: 0.5px solid var(--border-med);
      transition: opacity 0.15s;
    }
    .cta-button:hover { opacity: 0.85; }
    .cta-note { font-size: 12px; color: var(--text-faint); font-style: italic; max-width: 420px; }

    /* SECTIONS */
    section { margin-bottom: 4rem; }
    .section-label {
      font-size: 10px; color: var(--text-faint);
      letter-spacing: 0.12em; text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    }
    .prose {
      max-width: 700px;
      font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.8;
    }
    .prose p { margin-bottom: 1.1rem; }
    .prose p:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }
    .prose strong { color: var(--text); font-weight: 500; }
    .prose a {
      color: var(--text); text-decoration: underline;
      text-underline-offset: 2px; text-decoration-color: var(--border-med);
      transition: text-decoration-color 0.15s;
    }
    .prose a:hover { text-decoration-color: var(--text); }

    /* PIPELINE STRIP */
    .chain-strip {
      display: flex; align-items: flex-start;
      border: 0.5px solid var(--border); border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
      overflow: hidden; margin: 1rem 0;
    }
    .chain-step {
      flex: 1; padding: 1.25rem 1rem;
      border-left: 0.5px solid var(--border);
    }
    .chain-step:first-child { border-left: none; }
    .chain-num {
      font-size: 10px; font-family: var(--mono); color: var(--text-faint);
      letter-spacing: 0.2em; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; display: block;
    }
    .chain-name { font-size: 13px; font-weight: 500; margin-bottom: 0.25rem; }
    .chain-desc { font-size: 11px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.5; }

    .caption {
      font-size: 12px; color: var(--text-faint); line-height: 1.6;
      max-width: 640px; margin-top: 0.75rem; font-style: italic;
    }

    /* BEFORE / AFTER */
    .compare-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 1rem; margin: 1rem 0; }
    .compare-card {
      border: 0.5px solid var(--border); border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
      padding: 1.25rem;
    }
    .compare-title {
      font-size: 10px; font-family: var(--mono);
      letter-spacing: 0.2em; text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
    }
    .compare-title.before { color: var(--coral); }
    .compare-title.after { color: var(--teal); }
    .compare-card p { font-size: 13px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.7; }

    /* HIGHLIGHTS */
    .contribution-list { list-style: none; }
    .contribution-item {
      display: flex; gap: 1.5rem; margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
      padding-left: 1rem; border-left: 1.5px solid var(--border-med);
    }
    .contribution-num {
      font-size: 11px; font-weight: 600; color: var(--text-faint);
      text-transform: uppercase; width: 24px; flex-shrink: 0;
      padding-top: 2px; font-family: var(--mono);
    }
    .contribution-content h4 { font-size: 14px; font-weight: 500; margin-bottom: 0.25rem; }
    .contribution-content p { font-size: 13px; color: var(--text-muted); }

    /* NOTE BOX */
    .writer-note {
      padding: 1.5rem;
      border: 0.5px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: var(--radius);
      background: var(--bg-surface);
    }
    .writer-note-label {
      font-size: 10px; font-family: var(--mono); color: var(--text-faint);
      letter-spacing: 0.2em; text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
    }
    .writer-note p {
      font-size: 13px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.85;
      font-style: italic; margin-bottom: 0.9rem;
    }
    .writer-note p:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }

    @media (max-width: 600px) {
      .chain-strip { flex-direction: column; }
      .chain-step { border-left: none; border-top: 0.5px solid var(--border); }
      .chain-step:first-child { border-top: none; }
      .compare-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    }
  
</style>
